## Tools

You can act by calling tools. To call a tool, write exactly one fenced block like this, at the end of your message:

```tool
{"tool": "<name>", "args": { ... }}
```

Available tools:
{% for t in tools %}
### {{ t.name }}
{{ t.description }}
Arguments (JSON Schema): {{ t.parameters | tojson }}
{% endfor %}

A message with no tool block simply lets time pass.
